{
  "label": "Bulk History",
  "category": "Alert Acquirer",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Bulk History Management",
      "id": "bulk-history",
      "intro": "Bulk History mencatat dan menampilkan semua bulk operations yang pernah dilakukan, termasuk bulk classification, bulk assign, dan bulk reassign. Berguna untuk audit trail dan monitoring workflow.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Apa itu Bulk History?",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Centralized history untuk semua bulk operations\n• Track bulk classification requests & status\n• Monitor bulk assignment & reassignment\n• View details per bulk request\n• Support filtering & search\n• Audit trail lengkap dengan timestamp & user info",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.05),0 10px 30px rgba(59,130,246,.12);border:1px solid #bfdbfe;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6 0%,#2563eb 50%,#1d4ed8 100%);padding:18px 20px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\"><div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.18);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Bulk History</div><div style=\"font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);margin-top:2px;\">Track All Bulk Operations</div></div></div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">CLASSIFY</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">ASSIGN</span><span style=\"padding:3px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">REASSIGN</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Membuka Bulk History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik button **Actions** atau **More Actions**\n• Pilih **Bulk History** dari dropdown\n• Drawer akan slide dari kanan menampilkan history list\n• History di-fetch real-time dari API\n• Pagination support untuk large dataset\n• Bisa filter by operation type, date, user",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fffbeb;background:linear-gradient(to right,#fffbeb,#fef3c7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk History</span><button style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;cursor:pointer;\">Close</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Filter</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;cursor:pointer;\">All</button><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;\">Classify</button><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b;cursor:pointer;\">Assign</button></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Bulk Classification History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• List semua bulk classification requests\n• Setiap request menampilkan:\n  - **Request ID** & **Name**\n  - **Classification Type**: POSITIVE, NEGATIVE, SUSPICIOUS\n  - **Alert Count**: Total alerts in bulk\n  - **Status**: PENDING, APPROVED, COMPLETED, REJECTED\n  - **Created By**: Username & timestamp\n  - **Description**: Reason untuk bulk classification\n• Klik request untuk view detail alerts",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef2ff;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Classification Requests</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">BULK-CLS-001</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">⏳ PENDING</span></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">15 Alerts</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>Type:</strong> POSITIVE (Fraud)</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>Name:</strong> High Risk Transactions - Week 3</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>By:</strong> John Analyst • 2 hours ago</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\"><strong>Reason:</strong> Multiple suspicious patterns detected</div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;cursor:pointer;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:6px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">BULK-CLS-002</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">✓ COMPLETED</span></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">8 Alerts</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>Type:</strong> NEGATIVE (Not Fraud)</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:2px;\"><strong>By:</strong> Sarah Investigator • 1 day ago</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "View Bulk Request Details",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik salah satu bulk request dari history\n• Drawer akan expand menampilkan detail:\n  - Request metadata (ID, name, type, status)\n  - Alert list yang termasuk dalam bulk\n  - Status per alert (succeeded/failed)\n  - Approval info (jika ada)\n  - Timeline & audit trail\n• Button **View Alerts** untuk buka alert list\n• Filter akan auto-apply untuk show only alerts dari bulk request tersebut",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8b4fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f5f3ff;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">BULK-CLS-001</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">High Risk Transactions - Week 3</div></div><button style=\"padding:6px 12px;border-radius:7px;background:#8b5cf6;border:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;cursor:pointer;\">View Alerts</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"display:grid;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Request Type:</strong> CLASSIFY</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Classification:</strong> POSITIVE (Fraud)</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Status:</strong> <span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fcd34d;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">PENDING</span></div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Total Alerts:</strong> 15</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\"><strong>Created:</strong> 2024-01-15 14:30 by John Analyst</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Alert IDs (15)</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12345</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12346</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">#12347</span><span style=\"padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">+12 more</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Description</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;\">Multiple suspicious patterns detected across these transactions. All show signs of account takeover with unusual spending behavior.</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Filter Alerts by Bulk Request",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Dari detail bulk request, klik **View Alerts**\n• History drawer akan close\n• Alert list akan auto-filter untuk show only alerts dari bulk request\n• Header menampilkan: \"Bulk Request #BULK-CLS-001\"\n• Button **Close View** untuk kembali ke normal view\n• Alerts yang sudah di-process ditandai dengan border dashed hijau\n• Tidak bisa select ulang alerts yang sudah di-bulk",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0fdf4;background:linear-gradient(to right,#f0fdf4,#dcfce7);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"/><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h11\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk Request #BULK-CLS-001</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">15 Alerts</span></div><button style=\"padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg>Close View</button></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 0px,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 6px,transparent 6px,transparent 14px);border:2px dashed rgba(34,197,94,0.4);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12345</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">Suspicious Transaction • Score: 85</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">BULKED</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 0px,rgba(34,197,94,0.03) 6px,transparent 6px,transparent 14px);border:2px dashed rgba(34,197,94,0.4);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;\"><div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#0f172a;\">Alert #12346</div><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px;\">High Risk Account • Score: 92</div></div><span style=\"padding:2px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;\">BULKED</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "History Analytics & Info",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Bulk History juga menampilkan analytics:\n  - Total bulk requests (all time)\n  - Pending requests count\n  - Completed requests count\n  - Success rate percentage\n• Filter by date range untuk historical analysis\n• Export history ke CSV untuk reporting\n• Search by request name atau alert ID\n• Pagination untuk navigate large history",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fecaca;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #fef2f2;\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Bulk History Analytics</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:grid;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:6px;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#4f46e5;margin-bottom:2px;\">Total Requests</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#4338ca;\">48</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#d97706;margin-bottom:2px;\">Pending</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#f59e0b;\">5</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#15803d;margin-bottom:2px;\">Completed</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#16a34a;\">41</div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;\"><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#dc2626;margin-bottom:2px;\">Failed</div><div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#dc2626;\">2</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin-top:4px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:4px;\">Success Rate</div><div style=\"background:#e2e8f0;height:8px;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right,#10b981,#16a34a);height:100%;width:85%;\"></div></div><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#16a34a;margin-top:4px;\">85%</div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
